  "local_adaptations": [
    "Package renamed and declarations extracted by Go AST dependency closure; only protocol conversion and pure helpers retained.",
    "HTTP/account/settings/catalog IO, retries, ambient discovery, persistent signature store and subscription cache integration excluded.",
    "SSE writers replaced with synchronous framed-event callback; errors and limits belong to Alva codec.",
    "Standard encoding/json replaces upstream fast JSON optimization; native strict validation precedes parsing.",
    "Gemini builder retains pure request construction; Antigravity account-ID adaptation removed.",
    "Gemini call signatures remain typed state; no signature encoding or disk lookup through call IDs.",
    "Schema flattening removed; unrepresentable schema shapes must fail admission rather than silently weaken constraints.",
    "Native validated response chunks bridge into Magpie IR/encoders; native identity remains raw JSON.",
    "Native response decoding is reused from Alva and projected into Magpie IR; imported duplicate source decoders and text-call/think-tag heuristics were pruned.",
    "Streaming initial text is incremental; tools and later content are validated and sorted using authoritative native content indices before Magpie encoding.",
    "Gemini parser does not inject a structured-output request into system text; known output-format constraints stay in native fields.",
    "Pure net/url and net/netip replace net host predicates; protocol status codes do not import HTTP. MIME hints use a fixed table, not ambient OS files.",
    "Alva verifies source/target normalized request intent, unsupported variants, exact thinking budgets and flat-name collisions; compatibility degradation does not silently become success.",
    "The upstream unsealed helper preserves all raw schema values; encryption-required annotations and grammar-constrained custom tools are rejected before upstream billing, while literal schema data remains intact."
  ],
